          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A window insulation kit is the cheapest, fastest way to stop a drafty window for the winter. For most homes the 3M Indoor five-pack is the right start; the Duck Max Strength kit suits homes with pets and kids, the standard Duck roll covers a whole house, and the 3M Patio Door kit handles a sliding door you will not use until spring.
          </p>
